{"provenance": {"preset": "build-hub", "version": "0.7.0"}, "envelope": {"shape": {"entities": [{"type": "<type>", "fields": {"<field>": "<value>"}, "relations": {"<predicate>": ["<target>"]}, "body": "<markdown>", "source": "<the passage this came from>", "confidence": 1.0}]}, "supplied": ["type", "created", "updated", "generated", "status", "author"], "rules": ["Return one JSON document in the envelope shape and nothing else.", "Use only the types listed, spelled exactly; put each extracted record in entities with its type.", "Fill a field only when the source states it. Leave a field out rather than guess: never invent a value, never write an empty string.", "An enum field takes exactly one of its listed values; a pattern field must match its pattern; a many relation takes a list, a single one takes one target.", "A relation target is the id or an alias of an entity the workspace already holds. khub resolves it exactly and reports what it cannot, never linking by resemblance; never invent an id or guess one from a name.", "Never set the fields listed as supplied: khub writes them, and the add that captures a record sets its status and author.", "Quote the passage a record came from in source. Give confidence from 0 to 1 when a value is uncertain.", "A type that lists body sections takes its prose as Markdown under those ## headings, in that order."]}, "types": [{"name": "adr", "when": "a choice is made, rejected, or revisited between real alternatives \u2014 product or technical, including \"we considered X and are not doing it\". Capture the reasoning while it is still known", "id_shape": "ad-YYYY-MM-DD-slug", "fields": [{"name": "title", "kind": "text", "required": true, "enum": null, "pattern": null, "default": null}, {"name": "description", "kind": "text", "required": false, "enum": null, "pattern": null, "default": null}, {"name": "resource", "kind": "text", "required": false, "enum": null, "pattern": null, "default": null}, {"name": "tags", "kind": "list", 